<title>UK: JKX completes 14.2 mln stg rights issue.</title>
<headline>JKX completes 14.2 mln stg rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>JKX Oil &amp; Gas Plc said it received acceptances for 71.02 percent of its fully underwitten 14.2 million stg rights issue.</p>
<p>The rights issue of 46.7 million new shares at 34 pence per share was announced in February.</p>
<p>The proceeds will be used for extra working capital needed after slower-than-expected gas sales in the Ukraine as well as for capital expenditure in both the Ukraine and Georgia.</p>
<p>Dealings in the new shares started on April 15.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
